{"id":"nickerchen","lemma":"Nickerchen","pos":"noun","rank":4128,"glosses":["nap, catnap, snooze"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/7a/De-Nickerchen.ogg/De-Nickerchen.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"Nickerchens","plural":"Nickerchen"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich brauche ein Nickerchen.","en":"I need a nap.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to need","l":"brauchen"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Heute habe ich kein Nickerchen gemacht.","en":"I didn't take a nap today.","words":[{"g":"today"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"no / not a"},null,{"g":"to make","l":"machen"}]},{"text":"Machen Sie ein Nickerchen.","en":"Take a nap.","words":[{"g":"to make"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Falls du müde bist, mach ein Nickerchen.","en":"If you're tired, take a nap.","words":[{"g":"if, in the event that"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"tired"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"to make","l":"machen"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Falls ihr müde seid, macht ein Nickerchen.","en":"If you're tired, take a nap.","words":[{"g":"if, in the event that"},{"g":"you (pl.) / her"},{"g":"tired"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"to make","l":"machen"},{"g":"a"},null]}]}